  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, personnell exchange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will improve DDFinance Kenya&apos;s distribution structures, which in turn will help the company to reach more low-income households with affordable collective-based health insurance products. The focus will be on building sustainable cost-effective sales channels and education programmes. This involves business analysis, market development and branding, communication, and a continuing automation of several manual processes. The project is expected to leave a clear digital footprint in the insurance industry.</narrative>
  </description>
